  "notes": [
    "Complete list: 42 actions (src/actions.ts, one object literal registered with setActionDefinitions) and 1 advanced feedback (src/feedback.ts). No definitions are generated at runtime except the layer choices of the feedback.",
    "Protocol: OSC over UDP (src/osc.ts). Companion sends to the configured sending port (default 5000) of the Millumin computer and listens on the receive port (default 8000); host default 127.0.0.1, timeLayerName default \"layer\", trackMultipleLayers default false (src/config.ts). Variables and presets are not catalogued.",
    "Shared option helpers (src/utils.ts): index (number, default 1, min 1, max 4096), name (textinput, default \"\"), time and value (number, default 0, min -65535, max 65535), oscPath (default \"/millumin/action/custom\"), oscArgs. Number fields set no step or asInteger and text inputs do not set useVariables. The source does not mark any option required.",
    "Names copied from the source unchanged, including its typos: Select Board/Layer/Light By Name actions are named \"... By Index\"; Set Master DMX is named \"Set Master MDX\". The action id Action_SelectedLayer_StartOrPauseMedia is registered under the \"Stop Media\" action, while Action_SelectedLayer_PlayOrPauseMedia is named \"Start or Pause Media\" (src/actions.ts:43, 322).",
    "Several actions send a different OSC address than their id suggests: Save Project As sends /action/saveProject with the name argument; Select Board/Layer/Light by index or name share one address and differ in the OSC argument type (i or s); Selected Layer / Stop Media sends /selectedLayer/stopMedia, Selected Layer / Restart Media sends /selectedLayer/startMedia without argument.",
    "Jog Time reads the tracked firstByIndex media layer (elapsed time and duration) and sends an absolute /action/goToTime; it does nothing while that layer reports duration 0.",
    "Custom OSC: oscArgs is split on commas; each part may carry a type prefix i:, s: or f:, otherwise a number is sent as float when it contains a dot, as integer otherwise, and anything else as string. Unknown prefixes are skipped with a warning. It can send any OSC path to Millumin.",
    "The feedback colorpicker defaults are combineRgb(0,255,0) = 65280 and combineRgb(255,255,0) = 16776960. The feedback callback does not handle a layer id that is not in mediaLayers (an unknown id such as the default \"Global\" without a configured layer of that name would throw).",
    "Built on @companion-module/base ^1.11.0: options do not support expressions. The manifest file still says version 3.0.0-0; the version here is from package.json."
  ],
